          ],
          "threshold_unit": "amount_or_percent",
          "definition_text": "\u201cSpecified Reserve Account Balance\u201d with respect to any Payment Date will be an amount equal to the lesser of (i) $4,250,000.02 (which is approximately 0.25% of the Adjusted Pool Balance as of the Cutoff Date) and (ii) the outstanding principal amount of the Notes (after giving effect to any principal payments made on the Notes on such Payment Date).",
